# Settings for github.com/grafana/dashboard-linter.
exclusions:
  target-instance-rule:
    reason: >
      Service-level dashboard for a Deployment of interchangeable replicas
      (pods with churning names). Queries deliberately aggregate across
      instances and are scoped by the namespace/job template variables; a
      per-instance selector would break aggregation during rollouts. Per-pod
      breakdowns that matter group by the pod label instead.
  template-instance-rule:
    reason: >
      Same rationale as target-instance-rule: pods are ephemeral across
      deploys, so an instance variable would pin queries to dead pods.
